{"reviews":[{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-0","r":5.0,"t":"New fave! Eyelashes have grown! Will never go back.","x":"I will never go back to any other mascara after using this one. I\u2019ve bought 4 of these so far & they are the best mascara I\u2019ve ever used! Which says a lot since I\u2019ve been committed to doing full eye make up everyday for the last 8 years! It\u2019s also the most unique kind I\u2019ve ever used. It applies super easy just like most mascaras but it does not clump. When you go to wash it off it actually comes off in little goopy clumps.. like whole pieces! which sounds so weird but when it does this it is act","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-1","r":4.0,"t":"We shall see","x":"So I just received this mascara today and I will say it does make your eyelashes appear longer however it takes a few coats to build up to it. I will update later about how well it wears.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-2","r":4.0,"t":"Long long lashes","x":"The mascara is amazing.. gives you long lashes for days and it even let's you get the lower lashes with ease. The mascara wand is a rubber small brissesll that's shorter than expected but it works. The only negative is it's hard to get off without out using mascara eye remover..but love love love","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-3","r":2.0,"t":"They don't do anything different","x":"It does not elongate my lashes or make them appear thick; the other reviews were right. It's clumpy and thick. I purchased them specifically to elongate and thicken but... it's just mascara so I can't give it a big rating because it doesn't do what it said...  but it's not the end of the world.  Back to searching...","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-4","r":5.0,"t":"Long lashes, easygoing clean","x":"Can\u2019t go back to \u201cregular\u201d mascara after this. Need less other makeup with these outstanding lashes.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-5","r":2.0,"t":"Too clumpy and not very lengthening at all","x":"Made my eyelashes way too clumpy. I was under the impression it would be lengthening but my eyelashes looked even shorter than before. I have a different brand of 4D lashes that actually contains lengthening fibers and does a much better job than this brand. If you have naturally long lashes then this may work for you. Also very hard to remove so make sure to use an oil based makeup remover or coconut oil.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-6","r":3.0,"t":"Dries out fast","x":"It works but it dries out so fast So it clumps","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-7","r":3.0,"t":"Works but hard to remove","x":"This definitely made my lashes look longer and it separated them okay. I have to use a second mascara with a thicker brush after applying to finish. It is a very wet formula. Having said that, I do have to go back with a make up wipe and get the excess off my eyelids after applying. BEWARE it is very difficult to get off your lashes. If I am not showering and letting the water run directly on my face, I had to use a make up wipe, micellar water AND an oil and then back over with a wipe to get it","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-8","r":5.0,"t":"It does work, but doesn't come off that easy. Makes my eyelashes a lot longer.","x":"It makes my eyelashes a lot longer, saving me from having to wear falsies all the time.  It is waterproof, but it is a little difficult to take off.  I have tried all kinds of remover.  The best way I found is to put a warm washcloth over my eyes for a few minutes and then try to remove with makeup remover.  It is a bit wet when you first get it, so you really have to drag off the excess before applying.  After a few weeks, it is easier to apply.  It is still better than any mascara I have used.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-9","r":1.0,"t":"Awful","x":"This mascara dries like glue. Very hard. If I try to use a lash separator it will pull my lashes out so I can't apply a second coat b cause of that. The image in the presentation clearly shows false lashes not this mascara.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-10","r":1.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"I feel disappointed with this eyelash mascara!!! When I used it, it left a lot of lumps in my eyelashes, it left them stuck together and it pulled them down.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-11","r":1.0,"t":"Mascara is clumpy and thin.","x":"This item is NOT the same as the original  Vibely Xpress Control mascara but advertised the same.  Box is  different and mascara is a different formula.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-12","r":2.0,"t":"Not as expected","x":"Makes my eyes burn.  Never had problems with other mascara ever before.  It's chemicals are very strong .","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-13","r":3.0,"t":"You get what you pay for","x":"It was thick and clumpy, hard to remove and easily smudged, it stayed wet awhile","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-14","r":2.0,"t":"Wish it had lived up to description","x":"Two different applications in a week and each time super clumpy.  Disappointed.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-15","r":5.0,"t":"No Smudge Mascara","x":"This is probably the best mascara I have ever purchased. I get longer and thicker lashes with this than Lancome. It doesn't smudge and I have slept with it on several times. It looks the same when I wake up as when I put it on. It washes off super easy. You can't let it dry and go back over or it will give you spider lashes, so put as much as you want on while it is wet. Don't blow dry your hair after you put it on. Even slight heat will melt it into clumpy spider lashes. I have to dry my hair f","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-16","r":5.0,"t":"I will reorder!","x":"This is my second order for this mascra. It s almost a dupe for blinc but the formula is a little thicker which I like. It doesnt flake off and washes off nicely with warm water or make up remover. (Piture is of permed lashes with mascrca no other makeup on)","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-17","r":1.0,"t":"Hope you like to scrub your eyelashes off...","x":"Nothing takes this stuff off.  I lost a bunch of eyelashes trying to remove it.  When applies it makes it look like spiders are crawling off your eyelids.  Creepy.  And if they lashes stick together, well your screwed as there is NO pulling them apart.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-18","r":1.0,"t":"Removal not so easy","x":"Who ever said it is easy to remove, is full of it.  I tried using same removal process,  as I have used with other water proof mascaras & was not as successful removing this mascara.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-19","r":2.0,"t":"Clumpy","x":"I'm not impressed at all. Very clumpy and smudges very easily.  So disappointed.  I had high Hope's for this product. Don't waste your money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-20","r":5.0,"t":"Good mascara","x":"This stuff works but almost need a power washer to take it off. It does seem to become somewhat flaky after applying.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-21","r":3.0,"t":"Meh","x":"It really didn't make my lashes much longer and I found it tough to remove.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-22","r":1.0,"t":"Unimpressed","x":"I should have read the reviews first. Nothing special about this Mascara. \ud83d\ude44","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-23","r":5.0,"t":"Most important thing is it does  what it says it will","x":"Love this Mascara! Unbelievable, can't  believe that it really  works!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07Q69KHDK-24","r":3.0,"t":"Ok not that fantastic..","x":"It\u2019s ok my Big lash mascara from Maybelline looks just as good.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers say it makes lashes look noticeably longer.","cites":[2,3,5,8,9]},{"text":"A common complaint is that the formula is clumpy and thick.","cites":[4,6,7,11,12,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers find it difficult to remove, often needing a dedicated remover or warm washcloth.","cites":[3,8,9,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers are disappointed it doesn't lengthen or thicken as advertised.","cites":[4,6,11,12,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers report it dries out fast or dries hard like glue.","cites":[7,10]}]},"qa":[]}